{"title": "Whispering Statue", "pageid": 53755, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Whispering_Statue", "categories": ["Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">      </p><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Whispering_Statue.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Whispering Statue.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Whispering_Statue.png/300px-Whispering_Statue.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Whispering_Statue.png/300px-Whispering_Statue.png.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Whispering_Statue.png/599px-Whispering_Statue.png.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Whispering Statue.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"347\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"va\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Voice / Actor</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul style=\"list-style: none; margin: 0\"><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm4971258\">Bethan Dixon Bate</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm0101540\">Stephen Boxer</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm8830109\">Harriet Kershaw</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm7257504\">Frazer Blaxland</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm5235594\">Jessica Carroll</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm11062938\">Rishi Manuel</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm10343093\">Sofia Zervudachi</a></li></ul></div>\n</div></aside>\nA <b>Whispering Statue</b> is a kind of environmental object in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Whispering Statues are only located in the <a href=\"/wiki/Undercity_Ruins\" title=\"Undercity Ruins\">Undercity Ruins</a> and can be seen when climbing down the stairs from <a href=\"/wiki/Undercity_Ruins#The_Ambush\" title=\"Undercity Ruins\">the ambush</a> towards the <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal_Temple\" title=\"Bhaal Temple\">Bhaal Temple</a>. When a party member approaches a statue the first time, it recites a line from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Alaundo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/33px-BGWiki.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/44px-BGWiki.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alaundo's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/BGWiki.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Alaundo\">Alaundo's</a></span> Bhaalspawn prophecy.\n</p>\n<ul><li><i>\"The Lord of Murder shall perish...\"</i></li>\n<li><i>\"...but in his doom he shall spawn a score of mortal progeny\"</i></li>\n<li><i>\"Chaos will be sewn from their passage...\"</i></li>\n<li><i>\"So sayeth the </i>wise<i> Alaundo\"</i></li></ul>\n<p>After the prophecy has been told those statues which are approached a second time recite the following line.\n</p>\n<ul><li><i>\"But Alaundo did not see. He did not know. He did not </i>revel<i> in the glory of what is to come.\"</i></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Audience_of_One\">Audience of One</span></h3>\n<p>One of the whispering statues stands next to the murder scene, of which the corpse of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wilting_Alex\" title=\"Wilting Alex\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png/25px-Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png/38px-Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png/50px-Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wilting Alex\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png/25px-Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Portrait_Wilting_Alex.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wilting_Alex\" title=\"Wilting Alex\">Wilting Alex</a> is a part. Unlike all other statues which have a regular brazier which can be lit, this one has a brazier called <i>Audience of One</i>, which triggers a special line.\n</p>\n<ul><li><i>\"By now you've seen a lot of death, but this is mass murder staged as theatre for an audience of one: <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\">Bhaal</a>.\"</i></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034513\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.100 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.106 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4065/1000000\nPost‐expand incl